NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000167 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000168 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000169 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000170 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000171 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000172 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000173 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000174 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000175 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000176 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000177 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000178 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000179 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000180 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000181 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000182 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000183 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
